### Variables (VS Code REST Client)
@host = http://localhost:4000
@user = sebastian@fecovol.cr

### Estado de la API
GET {{host}}/

### Catalogos disponibles
GET {{host}}/api/catalogs

### Valores de un catalogo
GET {{host}}/api/catalogs/Posiciones/values

### Listar asociaciones
GET {{host}}/api/associations?status=AFILIADA

### Crear asociacion
POST {{host}}/api/associations
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: {{user}}

{
  "name": "Asociacion Deportiva de Grecia",
  "tax_id": "3-002-781245",
  "province": "Alajuela",
  "canton": "Grecia",
  "email": "voleibol@adgrecia.cr",
  "status": "PROVISIONAL"
}

### Equipos de una asociacion
GET {{host}}/api/associations/{{asociacionId}}/teams

### Crear equipo
POST {{host}}/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: {{user}}

{
  "association_id": "{{asociacionId}}",
  "name": "AD Grecia Mayor F",
  "category_code": "MAYOR",
  "branch_code": "FEM",
  "modality_code": "SALA"
}

### Nomina del equipo
GET {{host}}/api/teams/{{equipoId}}/members

### Agregar integrante
POST {{host}}/api/teams/{{equipoId}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: {{user}}

{
  "person_id": "{{personaId}}",
  "member_type": "JUGADOR",
  "position_code": "ARM",
  "jersey_number": 7
}

### Dar de baja a un integrante
DELETE {{host}}/api/teams/members/{{miembroId}}
x-user-email: {{user}}

### Buscar personas
GET {{host}}/api/persons?q=rojas

### Crear persona
POST {{host}}/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: {{user}}

{
  "document_type_code": "CED",
  "document_number": "1-1845-0932",
  "first_name": "Valeria",
  "last_name": "Jimenez Castro",
  "birth_date": "2004-05-08",
  "sex": "F",
  "association_id": "{{asociacionId}}",
  "roles": ["JUGADOR"]
}

### Verificar persona (FECOVOL)
POST {{host}}/api/persons/{{personaId}}/verify
x-user-email: admin@fecovol.cr

### Subir documento
POST {{host}}/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: {{user}}

{
  "document_type_code": "MED",
  "file_url": "https://storage/constancia.pdf",
  "file_name": "constancia.pdf",
  "person_id": "{{personaId}}",
  "expiry_date": "2027-10-14"
}

### Revisar documento
PATCH {{host}}/api/documents/{{documentoId}}/review
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: admin@fecovol.cr

{ "status": "VIGENTE" }

### Documentos por vencer en 30 dias
GET {{host}}/api/documents?por_vencer=30

### Designar arbitro
POST {{host}}/api/referee-assignments
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: competencias@fecovol.cr

{
  "match_id": "{{partidoId}}",
  "person_id": "{{arbitroId}}",
  "official_type_code": "PRI"
}

### Confirmar designacion
PATCH {{host}}/api/referee-assignments/{{designacionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-email: {{user}}

{ "status": "CONFIRMADA" }
